<description>&lt;p&gt;M23 rebels are advancing in eastern DRC, seizing towns and planning 3,300 houses to ease the Goma housing crisis, while ADF gunmen continue killing civilians in Ituri province. The FARDC was blamed for bombing a school in Minembwe, leaving 738 students without classes. Rwanda is preparing to serve as a European deportation hub for asylum seekers, provoking diplomatic protest from the DRC. Kenya and the DRC are discussing a détente that would require broader regional cooperation. 1,158 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixgFBVV95cUxNcS11cVFvdkxIb204RHl5SktwRVRZeE4xMjY3YmZBRW9WYlNldEJqN1FBdG1iRlZxSGhLd2k3WTZodnlzbWNNMU5fdmxySmdJLVdMcGJSeFEtSGphYjVjRExzbkxtSWZFY1RjTXppWVJXSXVhVEUwNGNKdnRQVk1uTTFSVTZSSXE0Y2h6bjVuLU1HVEpoa1AxSGxBWUhOTlhhMVFrM1BVWlE0em8taGdPMzBGRVo0UXExaFVKeHIweEg3cnJJWkE?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxONWR6WkZ3TU03ODNCYVBHdDBONFV6bFVWR013R2ZiSXNpWC1lYnRDR1BwVEN0cUNNd3lmWDRtaG8tdGsyMlY1aWxJZUpjejl3V1RHOEtydlc0VDNxcTh0d2puX1VsS2NnQmlMRDJqUkFxeGY2Mkk4aTYxMU00MGRYQXlzYmw0VWY3QjFnWk9rX2pPRTZUeXJLZTZJdTFQZGxHeW9rMHBUOXptbEFwOEp5dk1FRUk?oc=5&quot;&gt;OCHA&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMib0FVX3lxTE9ReFkyYV9qb1Y2dmxlMGFUc3pkXzlNdUowUXd4bFl1NC1uZ211TWhiSjhUVGRYekR5dTFjNGdwd0dkbmY4MEVTcVJ5SUFpbTFtNnZkcGdpLTA5MlR1VVdaRk9YXzZ3Mm50RVJfMGptRQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Taarifa Rwanda&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMibkFVX3lxTE5Bc0IxYnNrS1E2UGhzYlJIQk5kUWVVb2FUMjROREpUQUkyZ2ZrM3BsS0lEQXRpWVZ2WXhXbXlpN3pHSWhSdjFHUjYwb2psUkhGWWlKTU5CWG9oazZKZDJfYUh3U0